Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and then I think of when we were together \N♪ 偶尔我会想起我们在一起的时光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when you said you felt so happy you could die \N♪ 就像你曾说你幸福到仿佛可以死去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Told myself that you were right for me \N♪ 我曾告诉自己你就是对的人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But felt so lonely in your company \N♪ 但在你身边却感到如此孤独 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was love and it's an ache I still remember \N♪ 但那正是爱 是我至今记得的痛 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get addicted to a certain kind of sadness \N♪ 你会沉迷于某种悲伤 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like resignation to the end, always the end \N♪ 就像无奈接受结局 永远都是结束 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So when we found that we could not make sense \N♪ 所以当我们发现无法继续 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well you said that we would still be friends \N♪ 你说我们仍可以做朋友 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll admit that I was glad it was over \N♪ 但我得承认 我很高兴结束了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have to cut me off \N♪ 但你没必要彻底切断联系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Make out like it never happened \N♪ 装作一切从未发生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.31,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And that we were nothing \N♪ 仿佛我们不曾有过什么 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even need your love \N♪ 我甚至不需要你的爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you treat me like a stranger \N♪ 但你却待我如陌生人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that feels so rough \N♪ 这感觉如此伤人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to stoop so low \N♪ 你没必要如此不堪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your friends collect your records \N♪ 让朋友来取走你的唱片 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And then change your number \N♪ 然后换了你的电话号码 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that I don't need that though \N♪ 我想我也不需要这些了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know \N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know \N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know \N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and then I think of all the times you screwed me over \N♪ 偶尔我会想起你一次次辜负我的时刻 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But had me believing it was always something that I'd done \N♪ 却让我相信一切都是我的过错 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't wanna live that way \N♪ 我不想那样活着 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading into every word you say \N♪ 揣测你说的每个字 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you could let it go \N♪ 你说过你能放下一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't catch you hung up on somebody that you used to know \N♪ 而我也不会发现你还牵挂着曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have to cut me off \N♪ 但你没必要彻底切断联系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Make out like it never happened \N♪ 装作一切从未发生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And that we were nothing \N♪ 仿佛我们不曾有过什么 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even need your love \N♪ 我甚至不需要你的爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But you treat me like a stranger \N♪ 但你却待我如陌生人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And that feels so rough \N♪ 这感觉如此伤人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to stoop so low \N♪ 你没必要如此不堪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your friends collect your records \N♪ 让朋友来取走你的唱片 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And then change your number \N♪ 然后换了你的电话号码 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that I don't need that though \N♪ 我想我也不需要这些了 ♪
